1
00:03:33,599 --> 00:03:39,599
The Boys are back in town... and they have competition.

2
00:07:07,199 --> 00:07:13,199
Alvin and the Chipmunks: The Squeakquel is a comedy,
family, animation film directed by Betty Thomas.

3
00:10:40,799 --> 00:10:46,799
Pop sensations Alvin, Simon and Theodore end up in the care of
Dave Seville's twenty-something nephew Toby.

4
00:14:14,399 --> 00:14:20,399
The boys must put aside music super stardom to return to school, and are tasked with saving the
school's music program by winning the $25,000 prize in a battle of the bands.

5
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:54,000
But the Chipmunks unexpectedly meet their match in three singing chipmunks
known as The Chipettes - Brittany, Eleanor and Jeanette.

6
00:21:21,599 --> 00:21:27,599
Romantic and musical sparks are ignited when the
Chipmunks and Chipettes square off.

7
00:24:55,200 --> 00:25:01,200
Toby, played by Zachary Levi.

8
00:28:28,799 --> 00:28:34,799
Ian, played by David Cross.

9
00:32:02,399 --> 00:32:08,399
Dave, played by Jason Lee.

10
00:35:36,000 --> 00:35:42,000
Alvin (voice), played by Justin Long.

11
00:39:09,599 --> 00:39:15,599
Simon (voice), played by Matthew Gray Gubler.

12
00:42:43,199 --> 00:42:49,199
Theodore (voice), played by Jesse McCartney.

13
00:46:16,799 --> 00:46:22,799
Alvin and the Chipmunks: The Squeakquel is a 2009 American live-action animated jukebox musical comedy
film directed by Betty Thomas and written by Jon Vitti, Jonathan Aibel and Glenn Berger.

14
00:49:50,400 --> 00:49:56,400
It is based on Alvin and the Chipmunks and fictional girl group The Chipettes.

15
00:53:24,000 --> 00:53:30,000
It is the second in the live-action Alvin and the Chipmunks film series.

16
00:56:57,599 --> 00:57:03,599
The film stars Zachary Levi, David Cross and Jason Lee.

17
01:00:31,199 --> 01:00:37,199
Justin Long, Matthew Gray Gubler and Jesse McCartney return to voice the Chipmunks,
while Christina Applegate, Amy Poehler and Anna Faris voice new characters.

18
01:04:04,799 --> 01:04:10,799
The film sees the Chipmunks entering high school under
the care of Dave Seville's cousin, Toby.

19
01:07:38,400 --> 01:07:44,400
Meanwhile, Ian Hawke recruits the Chipettes to restore his career.

20
01:11:12,000 --> 01:11:18,000
Alvin and the Chipmunks: The Squeakquel was released in the United
States on December 23, 2009, by 20th Century Fox.

21
01:14:45,599 --> 01:14:51,599
The film received mixed reviews from critics and grossed
$443 million against a $70–75 million budget.

22
01:18:19,199 --> 01:18:25,199
It was followed by two sequels, Chipwrecked in 2011, and The Road Chip in 2015.

23
01:21:52,800 --> 01:21:58,800
The film explores themes of chipmunk, aftercreditsstinger,
duringcreditsstinger, woman director, live action and animation.

24
01:25:26,399 --> 01:25:32,399
The tone is lighthearted.
